      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>persistentVolume is an optional field that specifies the PersistentVolume that will be used to store the Insights data archive. The PersistentVolume must be created in the openshift-insights namespace.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><CodeBlock code={"`object`"} lang="plaintext" /></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Required</dt>
